# Node
node_modules/
dist/

# Cook artifacts: everything cook generates lives under .cook/ — caches,
# per-project state, and since CS-0207 the luarocks tree `cook modules
# install` populates (.cook/modules/). Ignore all of it EXCEPT the checked-in
# cloud config (.cook/cloud.toml carries project_id and cache.ignore_env per
# spec §9 and is meant to be tracked).
#
# There used to be a second, contradictory pair of rules for `cook_modules/`
# — `**/cook_modules/**` here and a root-anchored `cook_modules/lib/` further
# down — because that one directory held BOTH the install tree and the only
# legal home for a hand-authored module, and no single rule can be right for
# a directory that holds source and build output at once. The broad rule
# silently swallowed COOK-412's fixture modules, the suite passed locally off
# the working tree, and v0.13.0 was tagged against a tree CI rejected
# (COOK-430). CS-0206/CS-0207 split the two: generated goes under .cook/,
# hand-authored is ordinary tracked source addressed by path.
.cook/**
**/.cook/**
!**/.cook/
!**/.cook/cloud.toml
# ...with one deliberate exception. Four fixtures check in an INSTALLED module
# tree — the shape `cook modules install` produces — because the installed
# shape is exactly what they pin (name-form resolution, the share/lua/5.4
# candidate, a vendored cook_cc). It is generated content committed as a
# fixture, like a golden file. The negation is narrowed to `modules/` so a
# test run's own .cook/cache/ inside a fixture directory stays ignored.
!standard/conformance/**/.cook/
!standard/conformance/**/.cook/modules/
!standard/conformance/**/.cook/modules/**
!cli/e2e-fixtures/**/.cook/
!cli/e2e-fixtures/**/.cook/modules/
!cli/e2e-fixtures/**/.cook/modules/**
build/
bin/
# Vendored luarocks ships its own src/bin/ and src/luarocks/build/ trees
# (and tests/fixtures use bin/ directories). Don't let the project-wide
# build/ + bin/ ignore rules silently drop them — that's what caused
# Phase 2 M2.4 to fail on macOS the first time around.
!cli/vendored/luarocks-*/**/bin/
!cli/vendored/luarocks-*/**/bin/**
!cli/vendored/luarocks-*/**/build/
!cli/vendored/luarocks-*/**/build/**

